<attribute name="problem" nodeId="78f1de27">&lt;p&gt;
    The platform brings analytical rigor to the way that we navigate change, and supports data-driven decision making on
    our client’s complex transformational programs.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table title=&quot;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;10&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;./../../../core.default.tool_def.base/guidances/practices/resources/chng_insight.png&quot; /&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;p&gt;
                    Change Insights gathers, analyses and visualizes workforce data to inform a data-led change approach.
                    The insights identify where we need to target and tailor our interventions to enhance people&apos;s change
                    experience and better enable them to adopt the change.
                &lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Conducts behavioral profiling, and measures leading indicators of successful organizational change
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Ingests client data and is configured to each client and program
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="background" nodeId="8aa873">&lt;p&gt;
